  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obonene bw’Omonene bogotiga Hekalu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarigereria, nkarora igoro ase eanga eria yarenge igoro y’emetwe y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba egento kenga buna safiro, rigena rikomeka‐meka, nabaachire buna ekerogo ki’obonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene agateebia omonto oria obegete eanga y’egatani, “Genda ase egati‐gati y’amagoro aria anga chinyange, are inse y’egetongwa kebwate chimbaba, bwanchare namaboko ao omorero bw’amakara ore ase egati y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria, oyosiarere igoro y’omochie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Erio akagenda imorigereretie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba abwo nigo bateneine ensemo ya Irianyi y’enyomba y’Omonene, ekero omonto oria asoeteo, ne riire rigaichora ase eraaro ya ime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio obonene bw’Omonene bokaimokerera igoro, bokarua ase egetongwa kebwate chimbaba oria, bokagenda ase omoriibo o inse bw’egesieri ki’enyomba eria; enyomba eria egaichorwa ne riire, na eraaro egaichorwa nobomeka‐meku bw’obonene bw’Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eriogi ri’ogoakania chimbaaba chi’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria rikaigugwa ase eraaro ya isiko, buna eriogi ria Nyasae Omobui ekero agokwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Omonene achiigete omonto oria obegete eanga y’egatani agende korusia omorero korwa ase egati‐gati y’amagoro aria anga chinyange, korwa ase egati‐gati y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba, omonto oria agasoa agatenena ang’e nokomo kw’amagoro aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokerubi oria oyomo akarambora okoboko kwaye ase egati‐gati y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba bande, na agaanchara omorero bw’amakara orenge ase egati‐gati y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria bande, akayobeka ase amaboko ’omonto oria obegete eanga y’egatani, na omonto oria akayobogoria, agasoka n’oro isiko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarora inse ye chimbaaba chi’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria egento gekororekana buna okoboko kw’omonto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkarigereria nkarora amagoro aria anga chinyange ane mbarabare y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba, okomo kore ang’e ase kera egetongwa kebwate chimbaba. Amagoro aria nigo arenge kororekana anga buna kurusolito, rigena rikomeka‐meka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amagoro aria ane nigo agwekaine, kera okogoro nigo kwaroisirie kogasoanigwa nokonde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero amagoro ayio arenge kogenda, nigo arenge kogenda ase chinsemo inye chionsi, tarenge koonchoka, akaba akogenda gochia bosio rioka, korende ase okogoro kwa bosio kwarenge kogenda gochia, onsi nigo arenge kobwatia gochiao atari koonchoka ekero akogenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emebere y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria, na emegongo yabo, na amaboko abo, ne chimbaaba chiabo, amo namagoro aria ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria baane babwate, nigo biaichire namaiso ase chinsemo chionsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaigwa amagoro aria akorokwa “Oborundarundia”.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera egetongwa kebwate chimbaba nigo kebwate amasio ane; obosio bw’eritang’ani nigo bwarenge buna obw’egetongwa kebwate chimbaba, na obwa kabere buna obwa Mwanyabaanto, na obwa gatato buna obw’endo, na obwa kane buna obw’ebiongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amakerubi abwo bakaimoka gochia igoro. Ebitongwa ebio nabio biria narooche ang’e norooche rwa Kebari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria barenge kogenda naboigo na amagoro aria naro arenge goeta mbarabare yabo, na ekero ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria barenge korambora chimbaaba chiabo ase okoimoka gochia igoro, amagoro aria tarenge gwatananeka korwa ase bare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero barenge gotenena, na amagoro aria naro atenena; ekero barenge koimoka gochia igoro, na amagoro aria aimoka amo nabarabwo, ekiagera omoika bw’ebitongwa biria nigo orenge ime yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio obonene bw’Omonene bokarua ase omoriibo o inse bw’egesieri ki’enyomba y’Omonene, bokagenda bogatenena igoro y’ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ’nkarora ebitongwa bibwate chimbaba baria bakorambora chimbaaba chiabo na koimokerera igoro korwa ase riroba ekero bagendete, na amagoro aria naro akagenda amo nabarabwo. Bagatenena ase egesoero ki’egeita kia moocha kegochia ase enyomba y’Omonene, na obonene bwa Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli nigo bwarenge igoro yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebitongwa ebio nabio biria narooche bire inse ya Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli ang’e norooche rwa Kebari, na nkamanya ng’a abwo nebitongwa bibwate chimbaba barenge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera oyomo nigo abwate amasio ane, ne chimbaaba inye, na inse ya kera orobaaba egento nkiarengeo gekororekana buna okoboko kwa Mwanyabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amasio abo nigo agwekaine kegima buna aria narooche agwo ang’e norooche rwa Kebari. Kera oyomo akagenderera gochia bosio atari koonchoka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
